bash -lc 'set -euo pipefail;KRE="powchain|traderone|wolverine|fireinners";ROOTS=(/opt /root /srv /var/www /home);say(){ printf "\n[PATH-FLY] %s\n" "$*"; };have(){ command -v "$1" >/dev/null 2>&1; }
say "1) Dossiers dont le NOM match ($KRE)";for r in "${ROOTS[@]}";do [ -d "$r" ]||continue; find "$r" -maxdepth 5 -type d \( -iname "*powchain*" -o -iname "*traderone*" -o -iname "*wolverine*" -o -iname "*fireinners*" \) -print 2>/dev/null | sed "s/^/[DIR] /";done | sort -u || true
say "2) Dossiers qui CONTIENNENT un server.js (filtré par contenu/chemin)";for r in "${ROOTS[@]}";do [ -d "$r" ]||continue; find "$r" -maxdepth 6 -type f -name "server.js" -print 2>/dev/null;done | grep -Ei "$KRE" | sed "s/^/[SRV] /" | sort -u || true
say "3) Dossiers qui CONTIENNENT un package.json (filtré)";for r in "${ROOTS[@]}";do [ -d "$r" ]||continue; find "$r" -maxdepth 6 -type f -name "package.json" -print 2>/dev/null;done | grep -Ei "$KRE" | sed "s/^/[PKG] /" | sort -u || true
say "4) Repos git détectés (.git) (filtré par chemin ou remote)";TMP="$(mktemp)";for r in "${ROOTS[@]}";do [ -d "$r" ]||continue; find "$r" -maxdepth 6 -type d -name ".git" -print 2>/dev/null;done | sed "s#/\\.git\$##" | sort -u >"$TMP" || true
while IFS= read -r d;do [ -d "$d/.git" ]||continue; if echo "$d" | grep -Eqi "$KRE";then OK=1; else OK=0; fi; if [ "$OK" -eq 0 ];then R="$(git -C "$d" remote -v 2>/dev/null | tr "\n" " " || true)"; echo "$R" | grep -Eqi "Qcteck/POWCHAIN|powchain|traderone|fireinners|wolverine" && OK=1 || true; fi; [ "$OK" -eq 1 ]||continue; BR="$(git -C "$d" rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD 2>/dev/null || echo "?")"; REM="$(git -C "$d" remote -v 2>/dev/null | head -n2 | tr "\n" " " || true)"; echo "[GIT] $d | branch=$BR | $REM";done <"$TMP" | sort -u || true
rm -f "$TMP" || true
say "5) Services systemd liés (powchain/traderone/wolverine/fireinners)";systemctl list-units --type=service --all --no-pager 2>/dev/null | grep -Ei "$KRE" | sed "s/^/[SVC] /" || echo "[SVC] aucun match"
say "6) Ports Node actifs (si visible)";ss -ltnp 2>/dev/null | grep -E "node|:3000|:4001|:7001|:8484|:8585|:9696|:12701|:12702" | sed "s/^/[SS] /" || echo "[SS] rien"
say "FIN"'